  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 190 °C and line a baking sheet with parchment.",
    "Blend the cottage cheese, eggs and seasonings until smooth, then stir in the three cheeses.",
    "Spread into 2 thin rectangles (\"bread\" slices) and bake 18–22 minutes until set and golden.",
    "Cool slightly, flip one piece, add extra cheese and top with the other.",
    "Pan-sear like a grilled cheese until crisp on both sides."
